---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft data - commands (input -> output)
  convert   data -> data       Change format: --to json|yaml|toml|xml|jsonl
  diff      data... -> report  Compare two documents by structure, across formats
  format    data -> data       Pretty-print or minify: --compact, --sort-keys
  merge     data... -> data    Deep-merge documents; later files win
  query     data -> data       Query or edit with jq syntax: --expr '.items[].name'
  validate  data -> report     Check syntax, or a JSON Schema with --schema
More: deft data <command> --help
